Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.29,0:00:12.20,Default,First Mate,0,0,0,,Captain, we should be in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.67,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,You know there'd be no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:19.49,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,None of our weapons can do\Nany damage to those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:25.62,Default,Captain,0,0,0,,We've got no choice \Nbut to leave this to the hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:43.80,Default,Mob Hunter,0,0,0,,All of you, engage the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:46.84,Default,Tank?,0,0,0,,If they get past us, the front line \Nis going to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:07.42,Default,Mage,0,0,0,,I-It's no good! We're too low-ranked \Nto stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.84,DefaultItalics,Tank,0,0,0,,Damn it... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:12.55,DefaultItalics,Tank,0,0,0,,losing consciousness...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:24.52,DefaultItalics,Tank,0,0,0,,Healing magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.83,0:01:29.50,DefaultItalics,Tank,0,0,0,,Amazing. He healed me in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.20,Default,Tank,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.12,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,Byung-gu, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.03,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,Yoonho!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:37.87,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.69,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,It's the S-Ranks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.69,0:01:53.68,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,The S-Rank hunters are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.68,0:01:56.06,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,You're rushing things too much, Byung-gu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:59.36,Default,Min Byung-gu,0,0,0,,Sorry. I wanted to help \Nas many people as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:03.35,Default,Min Byung-gu,0,0,0,,Besides, I knew you two would protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:14.42,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,I don't think that's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:16.99,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Probably just the leader of this swarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:19.59,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Byung-gu, look after the wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:22.08,Default,Min Byung-gu,0,0,0,,I've got it covered, Yoonho!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.23,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Let's go, Eunseok!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:25.54,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.72,0:02:57.05,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,Pure brute strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:03.41,Default,Eunseok,0,0,0,,Guess it wasn't the leader after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:05.36,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Now this is getting fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:21.32,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,It seems they made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:27.27,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Now then, we should get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:30.10,Default,Hunter,0,0,0,,Guildmaster Choi, whenever you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:31.11,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:47.07,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Commence the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.85,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Over ten years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:59.84,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,a series of gates linking our world \Nto an alternate dimension appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:06.01,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,The other side of each gate teemed \Nwith bizarre creatures called "magic beasts",
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.37,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,immune to conventional weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:12.12,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Those who have awakened the abilities \Nnecessary to fight these beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.68,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,are called hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:17.86,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Based on the amount of magical power \Ncontained within their bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:25.29,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,they are ranked, in descending order, \Nas S, A, B, C, D, or E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:31.32,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,However, once these powers have awakened, \Nno amount of individual effort
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:35.00,Narration,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,can ever result in greater strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:00.54,Default,Hunter Associate A,0,0,0,,Good luck with today's raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:01.72,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.91,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Hey, Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.30,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:09.25,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey, if it isn't Park! \NWhat're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:12.47,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I thought you said you'd had enough hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:15.71,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,That was before my wife got \Npregnant with our second kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:20.22,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Makes sense. If the raid goes well, \Nyou'll be raking it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.51,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I'm pretty nervous, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:25.57,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,It's been so long that I dunno \Nif I'm still in good enough shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:27.28,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Not like I was that strong to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.75,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.73,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,What's up, Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.79,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,Nice of you to come out despite \Nthe chilly weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:37.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Good to be working with you guys again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:42.04,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey, Sung! You eat before coming in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:44.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah. I had a proper meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:49.59,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,What's with him? Is he a big deal? \NEveryone's saying hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:52.04,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,The exact opposite, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:55.79,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,He joined up after you quit, and that kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.86,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,His nickname is "The Weakest \NHunter of All Mankind."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:01.36,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Weakest? Not strongest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:02.30,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.30,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Like, a trip through an E-Rank gate \Nlanded him in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:08.41,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,He might be the weakest hunter there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:11.14,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Out of everyone? He's that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:15.04,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,So as a rule, you can assume any raid he \Ngets called in for will be pretty easy-going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:16.68,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:20.07,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'd hate for him to overhear us, \Nso let's leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.38,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Too bad I already caught it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:27.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, can't argue with the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.40,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Jinwoo! You're hurt again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:34.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Ah, Joohee... Looks like \Nwe'll be working together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:37.89,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Never mind that. What happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:40.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Same thing that usually \Nhappens to it, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:44.34,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You seriously need to be more careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:47.76,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I heard you even ended up in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:50.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It was an E-Rank dungeon, \Nso I was the only one hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.67,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Wasn't there a healer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:57.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Everyone else was higher-ranked, so... \Nthey didn't think to bring a healer along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:06:59.42,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.58,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,They were only thinking of \Nthemselves! That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:04.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's my fault for being so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:07.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You know how it is with me, Joohee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:09.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Looks like we're heading in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:19.79,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'll be your humble leader \Nfor this raid outing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:20.92,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,The name's Song Chiyul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:22.97,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:24.82,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.94,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Mr. Song's got the most \Nskills out of anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.76,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,It's a relief to have him in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Pleasure to be working with you, Mr. Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.07,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,All right. Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:37.06,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Let's head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:43.72,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hey, Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:47.89,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Try and hang in there behind us, \Nand don't get injured this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:49.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:52.07,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Let's give it our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:58.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A knife with barely any magic power in it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:02.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But it was all I could afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:04.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's better than nothing, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:09.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Today, I'm gonna see this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:20.66,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Welcome back from your meeting, Chairman Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.45,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,How'd things go with the administration?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.74,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,The usual talking points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.65,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Dungeon breaks are a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:33.03,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,but they still want the resources that \Ncan be collected from inside dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:37.84,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Their demands make logical sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:43.38,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,And we hunters make a living \Nby selling those resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:53.57,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,The stones collected from defeated beasts—\Nthese essence stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:54.92,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,They're valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I finally got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:05.59,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.36,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.71,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Stay back, Joohee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.93,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the next magic beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:31.75,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Joohee, look after Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:33.59,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:38.90,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You're going to be okay! \NI promise I'll heal you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:59.53,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,The essence stones collected \Nfrom high-ranked beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:05.21,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,can be turned into powerful weapons \Nand gear for fighting other beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:10.40,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Mana crystals that can \Nbe collected from dungeons
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:13.01,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,have a similar application, \Nbut they're less potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:15.95,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,But the government's \Ninterested in a different use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:19.40,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,As a new power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:25.34,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Safer than nuclear, more efficient \Nthan water, wind, or geothermal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:28.18,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,and one that doesn't pollute \Nthe atmosphere like fossil fuels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.63,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,The ideal clean energy source.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:33.85,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,They're working on a way \Nto generate electricity
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:36.36,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,using essence stones and mana crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:39.55,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,A rare fuel source that only \Nhunters are able to collect...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:43.83,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Which is why the duty that rests on \Nhunters' shoulders is such a great one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:52.36,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:53.77,DefaultTop,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,Yes! We beat the dungeon boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:54.90,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,That's Mr. Song for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:55.79,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:03.31,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, you're not staying on as a hunter \Njust because you're stubborn, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:07.23,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,If you keep this up, it's only a matter of time \Nuntil something much worse happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:11.18,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,It's not just your midsection. \NYou're hurt all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:11.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.33,0:11:16.32,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I don't want an apology! \NI'm worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:25.03,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Have you all collected your loot yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:27.55,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,As much as we could, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:30.37,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,There's not much in the way of \Nmana crystals here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.37,0:11:33.13,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,We're not gonna earn much \Nat all, at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.82,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.72,0:11:40.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And all I have to show for it \Nis an E-Rank essence stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:43.93,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hardly worth almost dying for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:47.27,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.02,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Take a look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:50.73,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,A cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:51.96,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,Some kind of tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:54.48,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,It seems to go pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.84,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,A double dungeon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.88,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I'd heard rumors before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:02.86,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,We beat the dungeon boss, \Nbut there's no sign of it shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.33,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought that was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:06.76,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:10.29,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's more loot \Nto be found down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:12.25,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:15.08,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,When encountering \Nunexpected cases like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:18.55,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,standard procedure is to wait \Nfor orders from the Hunter's Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:20.62,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec, Mr. Song...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:24.22,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean that the new guys \Nare gonna hog all the good stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:28.19,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,It's still part of a D-Rank dungeon. \NIt should be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:32.19,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,He's got another kid on the way. \NAnd we didn't find many mana crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.70,0:12:35.46,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,It'd be okay to bend \Nthe rules a bit, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.73,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:41.16,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel. \NBut the fact remains that it'd be a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:42.78,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Let's take a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.08,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.09,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:46.42,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,I say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.34,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:48.68,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:49.44,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.19,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.19,0:12:51.75,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.16,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,I say we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:54.09,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:57.05,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Sorry, but... I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:13:00.88,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,That makes six in favor, six against.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:04.03,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,You're the only one left, Sung. \NWhat do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:05.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:11.14,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Even a D-Rank dungeon is dangerous for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.96,0:13:14.99,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But... Now that Dad's gone missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:17.15,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can \Nprovide for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:22.07,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need money for Mom's treatments... \Nand to send my sister to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:25.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I need this money!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:27.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:38.02,Default,Associate A,0,0,0,,Now, if you could touch the black \Ncrystal with one hand, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:46.64,Default,Associate B,0,0,0,,Next, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:53.58,Default,Admin A,0,0,0,,You're a C-Rank?  \NWe'd love you to join our guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:56.59,Default,Admin B,0,0,0,,Here's the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.59,0:13:58.79,Default,Admin B,0,0,0,,You can find the labor \Nconditions detailed here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:07.20,Default,Hunter Associate,0,0,0,,Right. One B-Rank and two C-Ranks \Nhave agreed to sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:10.11,Default,Hunter Associate,0,0,0,,Things are going smoothly so far, \NGuildmaster Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:11.66,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,That's wonderful to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:16.38,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Age and gender aren't a factor. \NIf they seem like an asset, make an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.92,0:14:22.34,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Not that we're likely to find anyone \Nwho can compare to Cha Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.07,Default,Purse Snatchee,0,0,0,,Someone! Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.30,Default,Purse Snatcher,0,0,0,,Out of the damn way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:34.26,Default,Purse Snatcher,0,0,0,,Move! Or do you wanna get run over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.23,0:14:57.50,Default,Purse Snatchee,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:58.00,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:01.28,Default,Purse Snatchee,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.28,DefaultTop,Onlookers,0,0,0,,That's Cha Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:02.34,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,Cha Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:03.47,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,The S-Rank hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:04.61,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,Oh, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:05.48,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,It's really her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.48,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:07.39,DefaultTop,Onlookers,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:09.19,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.69,DefaultTop,Onlookers,0,0,0,,Can I shake your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:16.68,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,Look at her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:19.02,Default,Onlookers,0,0,0,,That's an S-Rank hunter for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:23.71,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,How long's it been since we entered the cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:25.64,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,About 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:28.56,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,The gate shouldn't close until an hour \Nafter the boss is beaten,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:30.14,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,so we'll have 20 minutes to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Um... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:34.50,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:38.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's because I voted the way I did \Nthat we're searching for the boss now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.63,0:15:41.96,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about me, so stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:46.91,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.54,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:50.30,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Have you already forgotten?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:54.35,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,If that attack had hit just a little higher, \Nyou'd be dead right now, Jinwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:59.62,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I was barely able to heal your arms \Nand legs, too! This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:03.19,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn't hit your head?! \NBecause it seems like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:10.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's true that having a B-Rank healer like \NJoohee around has saved me more than once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:12.71,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Do you actually understand the problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:13.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:19.62,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, maybe you should \Ntreat me to show your gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:24.44,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Or what? You don't like the thought \Nof taking me out to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Th-Th-That's not it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:27.56,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:29.05,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,It's the boss chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:34.73,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,Rare to see an actual door on one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.73,0:16:36.38,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,It's kind of intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.87,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.86,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,No way am I going back empty-handed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:42.98,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Same here. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.34,0:16:45.55,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,The team moves onward together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:48.36,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,That was the call, right, Leader Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:50.92,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:17:00.50,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,To the newly awakened: I am the chairman \Nof the Hunter's Association, Go Gunhee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:04.07,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Among you there are bound to be those \Nwho choose to be hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:07.46,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,and those who decide not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.08,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,It's been over ten years \Nsince the gates first appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:13.03,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,and yet there's still a great deal \Nwe don't know about the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:15.43,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,To become a hunter is to risk your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:19.46,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Even those who have grown accustomed to raids\Ncannot afford to let their guards down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:22.32,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,You must never grow arrogant, or careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:24.40,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,If you want to survive, this advice \Nwill serve you above all else:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.86,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Please, be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:36.97,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Hey, the place lit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.35,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Dig the atmosphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:40.54,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,I've never seen a dungeon like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.67,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,What's with the statues?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.68,Default,Yoon Sungchul,0,0,0,,They look so old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:55.46,Default,Kang Jeongho,0,0,0,,And some have instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.73,0:18:03.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This one's way bigger than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:05.83,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Damn, that's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:06.82,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,What it supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.40,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,There's something creepy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:11.50,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Gotta say, I'm not seeing any beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:12.32,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.15,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,Not a single one...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.86,0:18:18.04,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What is this? A magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:20.75,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,Mr. Song! Something's written over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:24.21,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,In the ancient script? Let's take a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.59,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"The Commandments of the Cartenon Temple."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.59,0:18:30.26,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"First, revere God."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:33.59,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"Second, praise God."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:32.38,DefaultTop,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jingwoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:37.43,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"Third, prove your faith to God."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:40.80,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,That big statue... I saw its eyes move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:43.69,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,It's been watching us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:48.44,DefaultTop,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"Those who do not follow these laws..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It can't be. You must have imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:51.07,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,"...will not leave alive"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.35,0:18:57.24,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,Hey! The door just shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:18:59.22,Default,Kim Guhyun,0,0,0,,But why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.22,0:19:02.06,Default,Ahn Yujung,0,0,0,,Are we trapped in here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.12,0:19:04.88,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,This is what I was worried about!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:07.04,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,You guys didn't take this seriously, \Nand now look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:09.95,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,We never should've come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:10.75,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:14.51,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,You can have the treasure, \Nor whatever else you find in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:15.89,Default,Jung Donghun,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.89,0:19:18.80,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.33,Default,Ladies,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:38.16,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:38.95,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,They moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:42.13,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Are we supposed to fight those things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:46.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The guy who just died...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.37,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Was he D-Rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:51.02,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If nothing else, he was stronger \Nthan me and my E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:55.01,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And he was just... in an instant...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:58.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense! \NThis is supposed to be a D-Rank dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be magic beasts \Nlike this down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:04.33,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,If these statues are moving... That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:22.20,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've stood on the precipice of death \Nplenty of times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:26.25,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,In my first raid ever, I got separated from \Neveryone else, and ended up stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:30.41,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've been attacked by E-Rank beasts \Nand spent weeks in a hospital afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:33.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I almost starved to death \Nin a labyrinth before, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:38.93,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No matter how low-ranked the dungeon was, \NI was always fighting for my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:44.02,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Most hunters are able to buy gear with the \Nmoney they make from selling essence stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.02,0:20:48.31,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,so they can beat even stronger beasts, \Nand reap even bigger rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:51.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But this cheap knife is the best I can afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:54.68,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If it breaks, I'll have to fight empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:58.57,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,These shoes are done for, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:02.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And so, day after day...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:08.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've endured being mocked, \Nand put up with a life-threatening job
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:10.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,where the risks outweigh the rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:13.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But even then, in order to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:16.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've learned to keep my eyes open \Nand look for opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:19.42,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That might be why I was able to tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:21.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Everybody, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:37.82,Default,Cho Myung,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:38.82,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,Nobody mentioned this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:39.83,Default,Ra Hyeyoung,0,0,0,,What is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:41.03,Default,Joo Jae-hwan,0,0,0,,How should I know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:42.18,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:44.42,Default,Park Beom-shik,0,0,0,,Yeah. How about you, Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:45.70,Default,Kim Sangshik,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:48.41,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,No more... No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:51.37,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:54.09,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:57.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We're trapped. We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:59.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We're dead. Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:04.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
